# --- apps/ ignores: read this before adding a rule (revised 2026-07-16) ---
# Built apps are USER DATA. They must stay tracked, because the version
# timeline and rollback read `git log -- apps/<slug>/`
# (routes_projects.list_app_versions_core). Only OUR OWN test junk belongs here.
#
# NEVER add an `apps/<verb>-*/` rule. _slugify (routes_aiuibuilder.py:187)
# builds a slug from the first five words of the user's build description, so
# such a rule eats real user apps by construction and does it silently, since
# `git add` on an ignored path is a no-op. The rules removed here
# (create-me-*, make-the-*, me-a-*, upload-*, *smoke*) were swallowing 11 real
# apps on prod, 8 via create-me-* alone.
#
# Generated test apps belong under the `_test-` prefix: _slugify collapses
# non-alphanumeric runs and drops leading empties, so a user description can
# never reach that namespace. Covered by tests/test_gitignore_app_slugs.py.
apps/_test-*/

# Generated video artifacts, NOT source: 5.9M of MP4s across 13 dirs on prod.
# Git never forgets a binary and these are regenerable. Scoped to `.video/`
# rather than `apps/vid-*/` because three real apps carry a .video/ dir too,
# and the app itself must still get version history. Mirrors the per-app
# `.attachments/` rule that claude_executor.py:37 maintains.
apps/*/.video/
# Junk on EVIDENCE (checked against tasks.project_members 2026-07-16), not on
# how the name reads. Every entry below is either owned by *@example.com (the
# reserved test domain, so a fixture), an orphan with no owner and no build
# row, or a prefix our harnesses regenerate on every run.
#
# Removed here because the DB says a real human account built them, so they are
# that person's data no matter how test-y the name looks: alama-flight,
# crudsimple, landing-page-for-aiui-bot-*, ralph-portfolio, test-crud, testfly,
# upload-c2f78c78, upload-da5312a9. If an owner wants one gone they can delete
# it in the UI. That is their call, not a .gitignore rule's.
apps/browser-smoke-*/
apps/build-smoke-*/
apps/caddy-auth-test-*/
apps/diag-test/
apps/e2e-4f3e4b/
apps/foo-app/
apps/smoke-upload-*/
apps/test-project/
